<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container py-5">

        <div class="intro-section mb-5">
            <h2 class="text-center" style="color: #004080; font-weight: bold;">Candidates of Islamabad</h2>
            <p class="text-center" style="color: #333; font-size: 16px;">
                Islamabad, the capital of Pakistan, has its own set of political candidates vying for MPA and MNA seats. Below, we highlight some of the major candidates representing Islamabad in the elections.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="candidate-boxes row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-3 row-cols-lg-4 g-4 mb-5">
            <div class="col">
                <div class="candidate-card">
                    <img src="~/images/faisal javed -w.jpg" alt="Candidate 1" class="candidate-img">
                    <div class="candidate-info">
                        <h5>Mr. Faisal Javed</h5>
                        <p>MPA Candidate</p>
                        <p>Party: PTI</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <div class="candidate-card">
                    <img src="~/images/shirin mirzai.jpg"  alt="Candidate 2" class="candidate-img">
                    <div class="candidate-info">
                        <h5>Ms. Shireen Mazari</h5>
                        <p>MPA Candidate</p>
                        <p>Party: PTI</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <div class="candidate-card">
                    <img src="~/images/asad umer-w.jpg" alt="Candidate 3" class="candidate-img">
                    <div class="candidate-info">
                        <h5>Mr. Asad Umar</h5>
                        <p>MPA Candidate</p>
                        <p>Party: PTI</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <div class="candidate-card">
                    <img src="~/images/aliya hamza-w.jpg"  alt="Candidate 4" class="candidate-img">
                    <div class="candidate-info">
                        <h5>Ms. Aliya Hamza Malik</h5>
                        <p>MPA Candidate</p>
                        <p>Party: PML-N</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <div class="candidate-card">
                    <img src="~/images/javed-w.jpeg"  alt="Candidate 5" class="candidate-img">
                    <div class="candidate-info">
                        <h5>Mr. Muhammad Javed</h5>
                        <p>MPA Candidate</p>
                        <p>Party: PPP</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <div class="candidate-card">
                    <img src="~/images/maiza hameed-w.jpg" alt="Candidate 6" class="candidate-img">
                    <div class="candidate-info">
                        <h5>Ms. Maiza Hameed</h5>
                        <p>MPA Candidate</p>
                        <p>Party: PML-N</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <div class="candidate-card">
                    <img src="~/images/president_of_pakistan_dr_arif_alvi-w.jpg"  alt="Candidate 7" class="candidate-img">
                    <div class="candidate-info">
                        <h5>Mr. Arif Alvi</h5>
                        <p>MPA Candidate</p>
                        <p>Party: PTI</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <div class="candidate-card">
                    <img src="~/images/senator_shibli_faraz-w.jpg" alt="Candidate 8" class="candidate-img">
                    <div class="candidate-info">
                        <h5>Mr. Shibli Faraz</h5>
                        <p>MPA Candidate</p>
                        <p>Party: PTI</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <div class="candidate-card">
                    <img src="~/images/mna candidate-w.jpg"  alt="Candidate 9" class="candidate-img">
                    <div class="candidate-info">
                        <h5>Ms. MNA Candidate</h5>
                        <p>MPA Candidate</p>
                        <p>Party: PPP</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <div class="candidate-card">
                    <img src="~/images/ali amin-w.png" alt="Candidate 10" class="candidate-img">
                    <div class="candidate-info">
                        <h5>Mr. Ali Amin Gandapur</h5>
                        <p>MPA Candidate</p>
                        <p>Party: PTI</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="table-section">
            <h3 class="text-center" style="color: #004080; font-weight: bold;">MPA & MNA Seat Count in Islamabad</h3>
            <div class="table-responsive">
                <table class="table table-bordered table-striped">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>City</th>
                            <th>MPA Seats</th>
                            <th>MNA Seats</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Islamabad</td>
                            <td>3</td>
                            <td>2</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    
</body>
</html>

